{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276280/extras/fdfdce6933351377d9a5440459696b08.avif?t=1763165695\" width=620 height=620 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After losing her original powers, the protagonist Lilina unexpectedly takes on the appearance of Imperial Princess Sofia\u2014and inherits the mysterious powers of a Spirit Witch. Her quest to uncover ancient relics and break the seal on the cursed armor Cecelia begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a refined RPG combat system, a deep transformation mechanic, and a sprawling main story with countless side quests, Lilina must overcome trials unlike any before... And you'll be there to witness it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276280/extras/776fafd0886287119bdc9b2e21520f7b.avif?t=1763165695\" width=620 height=349 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Story Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a tragic incident, Lilina's powers are sealed\u2014and she awakens to find herself transformed, now bearing the face of Princess Sofia and wielding the forbidden powers of a Spirit Witch. To retrieve the sacred relic and lift the curse on Cecelia, she must walk a perilous path, balancing the personas of both princess and witch. But in this chaotic world\u2026 defeat is far more harrowing than death itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turned into a witch\u2019s hound, offered up to the undead, impregnated by demonic parasites, used to brew liquor with her own magic and entrails\u2026 All of it in service of breaking the armor\u2019s curse\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276280/extras/f99d7342e45ebeed174d1af393766a14.avif?t=1763165695\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276280/extras_big/f99d7342e45ebeed174d1af393766a14.avif?t=1763165695 width=800 height=312 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f A True Seamless Sequel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds directly on the world and lore of Cursed Armor, with optional story recaps to bring new players up to speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Pixel Art Real-Time Combat System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam freely, dodge enemies, and unleash skills in dynamic real-time battles. Adapt to every enemy by switching between unique transformation forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd04 Transformation System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into 9 different forms, each offering unique abilities and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcda A Massive Script &amp; Multiple Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richly layered story with high player freedom, branching side quests, and multiple possible endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f 100+ CGs &amp; 20+ Outfit Variants</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of adult scenes and high-quality CGs, with detailed variants and interactive elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276280/extras/5cc57738c35b093ffacbdbce60ce2a28.avif?t=1763165695\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276280/extras_big/5cc57738c35b093ffacbdbce60ce2a28.avif?t=1763165695 width=800 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img